title: "context-pager: context paging for long assistant sessions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sahil
    given-names: Md Abdul
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdulsaheel/context-pager"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
abstract: >-
  A controlled study of how to shrink the context of long coding-assistant sessions: LLM summarization,
  recency, BM25, embeddings, a decision model, and paging (evicted items become stubs the model can recall by id).
keywords:
  - llm agents
  - context management
  - long context
  - evaluation
